      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاثِيَآءُ</span></b>  <i>One of the holes of the jerboa;</i> (TA;)
<i>like</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَافِقَآءُ</span>: (K:) or the <i>dust,</i> or <i>earth, of the
jerboa,</i> (IAar, K, * TA,) <i>which he throws up
with his legs from his hole:</i> (IAar, TA:) pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوَاثٍ</span> [like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوَافِقُ</span> is pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَافِقَآءُ</span>]. (IB, TA.)

